WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.422
General Translation recommends
nine checks in every locale,

2
00:00:04.422 --> 00:00:05.745
each with a pass condition.

3
00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:09.507
Check journeys, language switching,

4
00:00:09.507 --> 00:00:12.478
plurals, currency,
and text expansion.

5
00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:15.228
Then test right-to-left layout,

6
00:00:15.228 --> 00:00:17.539
screen readers, production assets,

7
00:00:17.539 --> 00:00:18.919
and crawlable URLs.

8
00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:24.479
Run gt validate, then npx gt
translate before each build.

9
00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.726
Your team now ships
Hebrew with each release.
